error: Invalid version passed (asdfasdf)

Pass a semver, or a full 40 character git commit hash, or a release channel name.

Usage:
Latest
  oden upgrade

Specific version
  oden upgrade 1.45.0
  oden upgrade 1.46.0-rc.1
  oden upgrade 9bc2dd29ad6ba334fd57a20114e367d3c04763d4

Channel
  oden upgrade stable
  oden upgrade alpha
  oden upgrade beta
  oden upgrade rc
  oden upgrade canary

From a pull request (requires gh CLI)
  oden upgrade pr 12345
